WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.435 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.403 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Also, it's Thursday.

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:04.104 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:05.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
arrived in Japan today
for the 2020 Tokyo Olympics,

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:12.078
so, now, they just need
about 1,000 more doctors.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
yesterday rejected

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.583 size:81% position:41%
two of Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy's picks

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.650 line:92%
to sit on the select committee

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.919
investigating the January attack
on the Capitol,

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:23.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
specifically, the podium thief
and the Viking guy.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Minority Leader Kevin McCarthy

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:28.261
has announced that Republicans
will run their own investigation

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:31.765
into the January incident,
so get ready to find out

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:32.899 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hillary did it!

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:35.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
Lawmakers in Las Vegas
have voted against a measure

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:40.106
that would impose a mask mandate
on tourists visiting The Strip

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
because, hey,
you're there to gamble.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
According to a new study,

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.279 size:81% position:41% line:92%
women spend more money

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:49.115 size:81% position:41%
on home decor, health,
and clothes than men

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
because, for men,
that's all one expense.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:52.952 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Hey, I cut my hand.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:56.656
Can I use that T-shirt
you're using as a curtain

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:57.557 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to bandage it up?"

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.793
[ Laughter ]
The world's fastest bullet train

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:01.127 line:92%
was recently unveiled in China

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:04.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
which can travel
at over 370 miles per hour

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
That means that,
in less than a day,

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:09.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
you could be on the other side
of the country,

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.337 size:78% position:39% line:92%
buying new underwear.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.906 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:17.210
Amazon has begun offering a more
masculine-sounding voice optio

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:18.945 line:92%
for its virtual assistant Alexa.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.847 line:92%
It's the only virtual assistan

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:22.916 size:88% position:44% line:92%
that will talk over you.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And, finally, today is

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:26.486 size:78% position:39% line:92%
National Hammock Day.

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't like to make plans
on Hammock Day

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:31.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they're really har
to get out of.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Ooh! Look who's venturing

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:37.564 line:92%
into the realm of Mike Scollins.

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bryan Donaldson
has made his move.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.902 size:78% position:39% line:92%
The Donaldson Gambit!

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:46.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And that's was a monologue

